  "body": "This is not just another new build — this is a truly unique, one-of-a-kind home that is extremely hard to replicate in Half Moon Bay.\r\n\r\nOffering 5 bedrooms, 4.5 bathrooms, 3 master suites, two living areas, a private backyard and internal-access double garage, this home delivers a combination of space, flexibility and practicality that buyers simply won’t find in a typical townhouse development.\r\n\r\nWith the Title and CCC now officially issued, there is no need to wait — the home is ready for its new owner.\r\n\r\nLocated in a quiet cul-de-sac and zoned for Macleans College, Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Pigeon Mountain Primary, this is a rare opportunity for families wanting space, quality and an outstanding location.\r\n\r\nLocation Highlights:\r\n• Zoned for top-performing schools: Macleans College, Bucklands Beach Intermediate, and Pigeon Mountain Primary School\r\n• Quiet cul-de-sac setting with a strong community feel\r\n• Just minutes to Half Moon Bay Marina – cafés, dining, ferry services to the city\r\n• Close to beaches, parks, and everyday amenities\r\n\r\nThere is only one like this — once it’s gone, you won’t find another.\r\n\r\nMust see this weekend. Come through, experience the space for yourself, and secure this opportunity before someone else does.",
